WEBVTT

00:02:27.757 --> 00:02:30.659
with a speech impediment.

00:02:30.659 --> 00:02:34.867
So, I might as well come clean about it.

00:02:34.867 --> 00:02:38.849
There are some interesting
angles to having a stutter.

00:02:38.849 --> 00:02:42.223
For me, the worst thing that can happen

00:02:42.223 --> 00:02:45.485
is meeting another stutterer.

00:02:45.485 --> 00:02:48.701
(Laughter)

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.908
This happened to me in Hamburg, when

00:02:51.908 --> 00:02:53.911
this guy, we met and he said,

00:02:53.911 --> 00:02:57.532
"Hello, m-m-m-my name is Joe,"

00:02:57.532 --> 00:03:01.793
and I said, "Oh, hello, m-m-m-my name is Meg."